cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RootRaven in your security research or assessments, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "RootRaven: Mobile Penetration Testing Command Center"
abstract: >
  RootRaven is a self-hosted web dashboard for Android and iOS penetration testing.
  It provides ADB shell sessions, Frida dynamic instrumentation, SSL pinning bypass,
  APK decompilation via JADX, SQLite database inspection, SharedPreference extraction,
  SSH shell access with automatic ADB port forwarding, Burp Suite CA certificate
  installation, and live device logcat streaming in a single browser interface.
